gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=P7 ROUTE A -- 8x velocity on ENGAGED DEFENDERS only, over P1+P4. Diagnostic.
// Tests whether vel_x/vel_y (+0x1B8) moves an engaged man, where speed_cmd
// provably cannot (P6). Gated twice in the cave: side byte != 0 (defence)
// AND engagement kind >= 4 (in contact). Amplifies his EXISTING velocity 8x;
// the question is only whether the field is live for an engaged player, so
// direction is irrelevant -- any visible path change is a YES.
// Hook is 0x00212974, NOT the store at 0x00212978: that word sits immediately
// before a jal and a jump there would collide with the delay slot.
// block-cycle.md predicts NO effect during kinds 5/6 (animation root motion
// owns both transforms). Kind 4/8 is the untested window this probes.

